    "criterion": "rational_capital_allocation",
    "verdict": "evidence found",
    "rationale": "The filing quantifies capital returned to shareholders in 2025 ($12.36 billion in repurchases and $4.42 billion in dividends) and states a capital management philosophy of prioritizing deployment for clients where returns are attractive and distributing excess capital to shareholders.",
    "citations": [
     {
