      "item": "7",
      "char_start": 448983,
      "char_end": 449166,
      "quote": "During 2025, we returned a total of $16.78 billion of capital to common shareholders, including $12.36 billion of common share repurchases and $4.42 billion of common stock dividends.",
      "sentences": [
       1,
